  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* feat: support config file in a `.config` directory (#1369)\r\n* feat(init): plugin options, preferred plugins, and adding above existing plugins (#1356)\r\n* feat: support Wasm plugins that use exception handling (#1371)\r\n* fix: show download progress for gzip compressed responses (#1358)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|c5eb2a8b07e12d32818ee9f3c19c708d88be2c974eedaab7c4a31e902e30f429|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|791560cf48299933a9fff2aea93b7e42b39e62d8a109634619d01c4f2c1aa68a|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|2d0be3f0aa8d3c55e4ae19de324353d2179dade2a05b0eda5bd80bc1b94579cc|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|1b826f7205f02d356f4a3072369626aec33d873fe6bd33246488cc8906563094|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|55a758b94fbe009acae7aefa7638c4820709e19b0bfaf268405c11af54f56f2b|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|5102aa940a060e48c33a5ceefce1273c701c6618503b7514323caada3b3649bb|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|21ac931303bb420bbdf3e0589506e5c32611c9fcff4ed2eb9802db657c499e9a|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|f9308f92d90ad8c5487730b5d8f90757e0e51070f075113d0e654f97f5d72a45|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|6366cda97e81de1bbc54d91d461e857afa595feb568bd1bec94ab2122e13d969|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|ff5d6b45c9fb1f49934af33ae20bec0c0655ccfdbce0a9a417ee706bc4171d6d|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl.zip|6bd2ff7c